    <p>After transferring, please email your donation details and transaction reference number to <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> along with your name, address, PAN (if applicable), and the purpose of your donation, so we can issue your receipt. You will be acknowledged within 3 working days.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How Can You Uplift Us?</h2>
    <p>The seamless execution of Kailash is possible only with the help of generous patrons and donors. You may support us in any one or more of the following ways.</p>

    <div class="card-grid card-grid--info">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Foster Parenting</h3>
        <p>Become a Foster Parent for one child for a year.</p>
        <p><strong>Monthly:</strong> &#8377;5,000 &nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Annual:</strong> &#8377;50,000</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Special Donations</h3>
        <p>Help us create a better future for the children:</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Celebrate a birthday</li>
          <li>Celebrate a festival</li>
          <li>Sponsor their puja gift</li>
          <li>Sponsor an activity (blanket/garments distribution, educational aids, food packets)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Purpose of Donation</h2>
    <p>When you email us your donation details, please let us know which of these you'd like your contribution to support:</p>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Shivananda Snehanir</li>
      <li>Vivekananda Snehanir (Foster Care Unit)</li>
      <li>General Donation</li>
      <li>Aid to weaker and ailing</li>
      <li>Educational Aid</li>
      <li>Festival and Ceremonies</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Donor Details</h2>
    <p>Prefer to fill in your donation details online instead of emailing them? Use the form below.</p>

    <!--
      Submits via Formspree (a free-tier form backend for static sites — no server needed).
      Set up: create a form at https://formspree.io, verify the recipient email, then paste
      the endpoint it gives you into src/_data/site.json -> formEndpoints.donation.
      Until that's done, submissions will fail with a 404 from Formspree.
    -->
    <form class="contact-form-static" action="{{ site.formEndpoints.donation }}" method="POST">
      <div>
        <label for="first-name">First Name *</label>
        <input type="text" id="first-name" name="first-name" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="last-name">Last Name *</label>
        <input type="text" id="last-name" name="last-name" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="address">Full Address *</label>
        <input type="text" id="address" name="address" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="pincode">PIN Code *</label>
        <input type="text" id="pincode" name="pincode" minlength="6" maxlength="6" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="mobile">Mobile *</label>
        <input type="tel" id="mobile" name="mobile" minlength="10" maxlength="10" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="email">Email *</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="pan-number">PAN Number (if 80G certificate required)</label>
        <input type="text" id="pan-number" name="pan_number" placeholder="Enter PAN Number">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="purpose">Purpose of Donation *</label>
        <select id="purpose" name="purpose" required>
          <option value="">Select Purpose of Donation</option>
          <option>Shivananda Snehanir</option>
          <option>Vivekananda Snehanir (Foster Care Unit)</option>
          <option>General Donation</option>
          <option>Aid to weaker and ailing</option>
          <option>Educational Aid</option>
          <option>Festival and Ceremonies</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="transaction-id">Transaction Ref. No. *</label>
        <input type="text" id="transaction-id" name="transaction_id" required>
      </div>
      <p class="contact-form-static__note">You will be acknowledged within 3 working days through the email above.</p>
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New donation form submission from kailash-shivanandam.com">
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ '/thank-you/' | url }}">
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
